# Dependency Version Alignment
RULE: Check codex before adding/updating deps. Use standard versions: ruff==0.15.0, pytest>=9.0.1, numpy>=2.1.0, pandas>=2.2.3.
WHY: Prevents import failures, test incompatibilities, deployment issues across 30+ repos.
CODEX: 06-coding-standards/dependency-management.md, .cursor/workspace-configs/check-dependency-alignment.sh
DO: Update codex first if new dep; update ALL repos; run `uv lock`; use resolve-version-conflicts.py to detect drift
NEVER: Add dep without codex check; update one repo only; skip uv.lock
See also: `uv-lock-file.mdc` — how to maintain the lock file (lock file mechanics); this rule covers version selection only.
